    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u06.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "there is / there are (review)",
        "ru": "there is / there are (повторение)"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "Say what a place has with \"there is\" (one thing) and \"there are\" (many). Use \"some\" for plurals and \"any\" in questions and negatives.",
        "ru": "Что есть в месте — через \"there is\" (один предмет) и \"there are\" (много). \"some\" — с множественным, \"any\" — в вопросах и отрицаниях."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "there is",
            "ru": "there is"
          },
          "formula": "There is a + singular",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "There is a sofa in the room.",
              "ru": "В комнате есть диван."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "there-is"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "there are",
            "ru": "there are"
          },
          "formula": "There are + plural",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "There are two chairs.",
              "ru": "Есть два стула."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "there-is"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "any",
            "ru": "any"
          },
          "formula": "Is there…? · There aren't any…",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Is there a table? There aren't any windows.",
              "ru": "Есть стол? Окон нет."
            }
          ],
          "ref": "there-is"
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Match the verb to the noun: \"there is one bed\", \"there are two beds\".",
          "ru": "Согласуй глагол с существительным: \"there is one bed\", \"there are two beds\"."
        },
        {
          "en": "Use \"any\", not \"some\", in questions and negatives: \"Is there any milk?\"",
          "ru": "В вопросах и отрицаниях — \"any\", не \"some\": \"Is there any milk?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u06.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "My new flat",
        "ru": "Моя новая квартира"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u06.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "I have a new flat in the city. It is not big, but it is comfortable. There is a small kitchen, one bedroom and a bright living room.",
          "ru": "У меня новая квартира в городе. Она небольшая, но уютная. Есть маленькая кухня, одна спальня и светлая гостиная.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u06.d01.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u06.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "In the living room there is a soft sofa and a low table. There are two big windows, so the room is full of light. I love my new home.",
          "ru": "В гостиной стоит мягкий диван и низкий стол. Есть два больших окна, поэтому в комнате много света. Я люблю свой новый дом.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u06.d01.reading.b2.mp3",
